  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Kí hiệu các đỉnh của hình chóp cụt và tâm của hai đáy như hình vẽ bên.<br>Trong hình thang vuông <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, vẽ đường cao <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow></semantics></math> (<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>). Do <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>∥</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>. Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Trong tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>H</mi></semantics></math>, ta có<br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>H</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>6</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.</div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/deb4f8670ffcda46297ece63d338166a7d21f447dc1270ce66977778214bb097.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>\n\t\t Trong <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>, vẽ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>K</mi><mo>∥</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> (<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math>). Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>K</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>H</mi><mi>K</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>H</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>K</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>K</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là đường cao của mặt bên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>K</mi><mo>∥</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>H</mi><mi>K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mi>H</mi><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Trong tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>K</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>H</mi></semantics></math> ta có:\n\t\t<math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>H</mi><msup><mi>K</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.",
